                    <ul>
                        <li>
                            <i class="bx bx-check-double"></i> Forecast of probability of failure during an average of 36 hours of continuous locomotive operation <strong>1</strong> day from the date of the forecast using data from <strong>6</strong> days before the date of the forecast
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <i class="bx bx-check-double"></i> The same, after <strong>7</strong> days from used data for <strong>7</strong> days
